    <item>
      <title>昨天三级了，但是太忙了忘记提肛打卡了（悲，索性把几年前买的好久没用的一元机场订阅送出来（希望有人要，浪费好久了</title>
      <link>https://linux.do/t/topic/2352702</link>
      <guid>linux.do-topic-2352702</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 09 Jun 2026 09:00:17 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>
            &lt;p&gt;（提肛打卡第二周就断了，悲&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/e/4/d/e4d95cf48bf017fab48a41140c633bd47487efb6.png&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/wEuyOFUJ0fFQWOV0pytOIdXtJAy.png?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;d31c41922e4e7709262bb845df445dfa&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/e/4/d/e4d95cf48bf017fab48a41140c633bd47487efb6_2_690x203.png&quot; alt=&quot;d31c41922e4e7709262bb845df445dfa&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;wEuyOFUJ0fFQWOV0pytOIdXtJAy&quot; width=&quot;690&quot; height=&quot;203&quot; srcset=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/e/4/d/e4d95cf48bf017fab48a41140c633bd47487efb6_2_690x203.png, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/e/4/d/e4d95cf48bf017fab48a41140c633bd47487efb6_2_1035x304.png 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/e/4/d/e4d95cf48bf017fab48a41140c633bd47487efb6.png 2x&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;F6F5F5&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;这个一元机场是我四年前买的，那时候还是 500G，但是现在只有 50G的套餐了，所以我也不知道到底有多少&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/1/c/1/1c1b4f91fa4106e554622a17ede7909a08cc3914.png&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/40DSHHDFJoY5XcCs5mcBH9peizi.png?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;8832c31aebdea05c9f5159bdd1c1a4aa&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/1/c/1/1c1b4f91fa4106e554622a17ede7909a08cc3914_2_690x194.png&quot; alt=&quot;8832c31aebdea05c9f5159bdd1c1a4aa&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;40DSHHDFJoY5XcCs5mcBH9peizi&quot; width=&quot;690&quot; height=&quot;194&quot; srcset=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/1/c/1/1c1b4f91fa4106e554622a17ede7909a08cc3914_2_690x194.png, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/1/c/1/1c1b4f91fa4106e554622a17ede7909a08cc3914_2_1035x291.png 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/1/c/1/1c1b4f91fa4106e554622a17ede7909a08cc3914_2_1380x388.png 2x&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;F8F8FA&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;私聊我我直接发你订阅链接&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;我发你的一定能用订阅下来，如果太多人用订阅被重置了也可以找我（&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;（一元机场的质量大家自行评估，建议仅当做权重不高的备用&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;一般而言，傍晚晚上一元机场流量会很高，线路繁忙会很多节点不能用（当然别的时间也可能出现这种情况&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;（我怎么这么爱用括号啊&lt;/p&gt;
            &lt;p&gt;&lt;small&gt;3 个帖子 - 3 位参与者&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
            &lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://linux.do/t/topic/2352702&quot;&gt;阅读完整话题&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
          </description>
    </item>
